  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Given below are two statements: one is labelled as&nbsp;Assertion <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math>&nbsp;and the other is labelled as&nbsp;Reason&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi><mo>.</mo></math></p><p><strong>Assertion A</strong>:&nbsp;When a body is projected at an angle <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>45</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;its range is maximum.</p><p><strong>Reason R</strong>:&nbsp;For maximum range, the value of sin <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>&#952;</mi></math>&nbsp;should be equal to one.</p><p>In the light of the above statements, choose the&nbsp;correct&nbsp;answer from the options given below:</p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "WJTWX",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math>&nbsp;is false but&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi></math>&nbsp;is true",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gfKTa",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math>&nbsp;is true but&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi></math>&nbsp;is false",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ncI2n",
      "text": "<p>Both <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi></math> are correct and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi></math> is the correct explanation of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math></p>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "tMUt1",
      "text": "<p>Both <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi></math> are correct but <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi></math> is NOT the correct explanation of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math></p>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Horizontal range of a projectile from a horizontal plane is given by,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>u</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow><mi>g</mi></mfrac></math>.</p><p>Clearly for maximum range,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>.</p><p>Therefore,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>45</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></math>.</p></blockquote>",
    "image": null
  },
